---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="AI Agent Worx — Intelligent agents that work">
	<section>
		<h1>AI agents that actually work.</h1>
		<p class="lede">
			AI Agent Worx builds practical, reliable AI agents for businesses ready to put intelligence to work — not just talk about it.
		</p>
		<a href="/contact" class="btn">Get in touch</a>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>What we do</h2>
		<div class="grid">
			<div class="card">
				<h3>Custom AI Agents</h3>
				<p>Tailored agents that handle real workflows — research, outreach, ops, support — and integrate with the tools you already use.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<h3>Automation</h3>
				<p>Replace repetitive tasks with agents that get smarter over time. Less busywork, more output.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="card">
				<h3>Strategy</h3>
				<p>Not sure where AI fits? We help you find the highest-leverage places to deploy it — and skip the hype.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section>
		<h2>Why AI Agent Worx</h2>
		<p>
			There's a flood of AI tools out there. Most are demos. We build agents that ship — robust, observable, and grounded in your business.
		</p>
	</section>
</Layout>
